From: CHEN Xuan <chenxuan@iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] comgr: link LLVM dependencies of installed llvm_gtest

The installed LLVM gtest archives use LLVM Support for command-line
handling and diagnostics. GTEST_NO_LLVM_SUPPORT only affects the test
translation unit, not those archives. Match COMGRs LLVM linkage mode.

--- a/amd/comgr/test-unit/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/amd/comgr/test-unit/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -78,6 +78,7 @@
 target_link_libraries(DemangleSymbolNameTest PRIVATE
   ${COMGR_GTEST_LIBS}
   amd_comgr
+  ${LLVM_LIBS}
   ${LLVM_PTHREAD_LIB})

 # Gtest's LLVM support brings in some printers for LLVM types (StringRef, etc.).
